537	            <h2>Modern Web Template</h2>
538	            <p>This is an improved HTML template built with best practices for performance, accessibility, and maintainability.</p>
539	        </article>
540	
541	        <article id="features">
542	            <h2>Key Features</h2>
543	            <p>
544	                This template includes semantic HTML elements, responsive design, modern CSS with gradients,
545	                proper meta tags for SEO, and accessibility considerations to create a solid foundation for any web project.
546	            </p>
547	            <ul class="feature-list">
548	                <li>Semantic HTML5 structure</li>
549	                <li>WCAG 2.1 accessibility compliance</li>
550	                <li>Mobile-first responsive design</li>
551	                <li>Keyboard navigation support</li>
552	                <li>Open Graph meta tags</li>
553	            </ul>
554	            <button type="button" class="cta-button" id="learn-more-btn" aria-label="Learn more and contact us">Learn More</button>
555	        </article>
